; Stage 15 W9 item 30 negative fixture: the CONSTANT-FOLDER path applies the
; same rule as the value path.
;
; `defvar-init-ir` renders a global's initializer by hand — it has no
; instruction stream — so it is a second asker of "may `as` narrow this?" and
; would drift if it re-derived the answer. It calls `as-float-narrowing`
; instead, so this global is refused with the identical wording the local
; spelling gets (w9-as-float-inexact.nuc).
;
; Compiling this must FAIL with:
;   "as: lossy conversion from f64 to f32 -- use unsafe/cast"
(defvar w9asf-bad:f32 (as f32 3.14))

(defn main ():i32
  (return 0))
